::PC_U01_L07_GP01::
Question ID: PC_U01_L07_GP01
MLA Standard: MLA.PC.MOD.1
Question:
What is the solution to the system y = x + 2 and y = 5?
{
=A. (3, 5)#Correct. The choice satisfies the stated system, graph interpretation, or piecewise interval condition.
~B. (5, 3)#This choice reflects a common mix-up with coordinates or interval boundaries. Use the given equations or inequalities directly.
~C. (2, 5)#This choice uses part of the information but not the full condition. Verify the value in the model.
~D. (7, 5)#This choice does not satisfy the required model condition. Recheck the equation or interval.
}
